# design-sync — ⚠️ the WHOLE TREE is untracked as of 2026-08-20, and it used to
# be only the machine state below it. It is the export surface for a
# claude.ai/design project: an entry barrel, two shims, fixtures, 56 authored
# previews and 16 woff2. **Nothing this app serves comes out of it** — it is
# already `.dockerignore`d, so the image never saw it either — and it is the
# owner's design tooling rather than part of the instrument.
#
# ⚠️ **It is still on disk and the `/design-sync` skill still runs**, which is
# the point of untracking rather than deleting. What changed is that a clone
# does not get it, so `web/CLAUDE.md`'s section on it describes something a
# reader of this repo cannot see. That is stated at the section.
#
# ⚠️ `package.json`'s `"types": ".design-sync/entry.tsx"` is what lets the prop
# contracts extract. It has no effect on Next and a clone missing the file
# builds normally — verified 2026-08-20 by building with the tree moved aside.
.design-sync/
.ds-sync/
ds-bundle/
